{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab11f19002c37acb435b2dceca20da447e56b0730248fee3f095c6bbcd1dc58e", "ja": "（雑誌の企画で、海釣りをすることになった海美。\n大量に釣れて、必要な写真も無事撮る事ができた！）", "zh": "（海美因为杂志企划而去海钓。\n她成功钓到大量的鱼，也顺利拍到需要的照片了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "960367d6eb6e9fb4f2341d74771814cf36eea6b133e5fe7c9ce4ae8e691cf0c3", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！\n釣り、楽しかったねーっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了！\n钓鱼真开心呢──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1002_p", "source_sha256": "efb20c2f7823e0e00cc63c4d178c950c485c13acee3a9729718753d3e4754839", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。海美も、思ったより\n釣りを楽しめたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "是啊，辛苦你了。\n你好像比我预期的更享受钓鱼，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "2908744c8b85cddc1e3fbd4df81f4da04410c378236195762e6c030588f580cc", "ja": "うん！　たくさん釣れて、楽しかったーっ！\n揺れる船の上で、バランス感覚も鍛えられたしね♪", "zh": "嗯！钓到很多鱼，我很开心──！\n而且在摇晃的船上，也能锻炼平衡感呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7579afcbbc58b7bfcdf2f4cca924fdfab6c2c68698cdbd401b2838e38b894aa5", "ja": "船の上で何かやっていると思ったが、\nそんな事をしていたのか……。", "zh": "我还想你在船上是在做什么，\n结果是在练平衡感啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "591ab9c8e36950801f38266fe6f4e42328d208b184e1201f68cf6ae52a896a16", "ja": "うん！　それに、漁師さんが\n何匹かお刺身にしてくれたでしょ。", "zh": "嗯！还有，渔夫不是杀了好几条鱼，\n做成生鱼片给我们吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d76f2f32c539e5a04ab92e11518ca399fec8965747e6711331fa4783806bd86", "ja": "パパーっと捌いちゃった時には驚いたけど、\nお刺身、新鮮ですっごく美味しかったよねー！", "zh": "看他俐落地杀鱼时，我虽然有点吓到，\n但生鱼片很新鲜、超好吃的呢──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3ba4b5719733af4e93b0dc2bb880c33140f9753daeb2b79a21a1e2cdfd6d1b20", "ja": "うん、そうだな。釣ったばかりの魚を\n船の上で食べるのは、釣りの醍醐味だな。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊。\n在船上吃现钓的鱼，就是钓鱼的有趣之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "5eefb2910a9169c1a7da120f41be69be150d2c9ac84e36a70a1a32ac7f6d1ebc", "ja": "魚をきれいに捌いて、お刺身にして……\n釣りって、もしかしてすっごく女子力高い！？", "zh": "把鱼处理得干干净净，再做成生鱼片……\n难不成钓鱼是种女子力很高的活动！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "e846cf4f7c9b5f4614c38ebf36a7708f11f8658e2f2cfb691193f1cd68bfdc6c", "ja": "いっぱい釣りしたら私も、魚をしゅぱぱーって\n三枚におろせるようになるのかも！？", "zh": "我要是钓了很多鱼，\n说不定也能三两下就把鱼切片去骨！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ab997cad3050e90e8c018e1b95028dc82cfab4529f2beeeeb0c125c21cccc4d", "ja": "{$P$}！\n私、もう一回、釣りに行ってくる！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我再去钓一次鱼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0112_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fbcdd326b6fc0721ef908999a6e09d73e33d6765ed1818f50df3a5ec7acc980d", "ja": "え？　三枚におろすなら、買ってくるだけで……\nおーい、海美！　帰ってこーい！", "zh": "咦？要切片去骨的话，只要去买鱼就好……\n喂──海美！快点回来──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
